# Sustainable Fashion Research Plan<br>
<br>
## Introduction<br>
<br>
As a sustainable fashion advocate, I aim to explore ways to reduce waste in the fashion industry. This research plan outlines my approach to conducting interviews with potential designers and manufacturers.<br>
<br>
## Research Questions<br>
<br>
* What steps are being taken to reduce waste in production processes?<br>
* How do companies ensure that materials used in products are sustainably sourced?<br>
<br>
## Potential Designers/Manufacturers<br>
<br>
* Fashion Nova<br>
* Vogue<br>
<br>
## Interview Questions<br>
<br>
1. What steps are you taking to reduce waste in your production process?<br>
2. How do you ensure that all materials used in your products are sustainably sourced?<br>
<br>
